    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Cats are some of the best vermin hunters in the Old World. Confident, silent hunters, they roam everywhere, from the echoing halls of the great and good down to the dirtiest, lowliest hovel. There they catch mice, spiders, rats, and other small creatures. Many are so independent that they don't even require much in the way of feeding. Because they are so common, Cats are some of the cheapest animals to buy.</p>\n<p><strong>Commonly Owned By:</strong> Hedge Witch, Townsmen, Villagers, Warden, Witches, Wizards</p>"
